Every GCC environment repeats the same compiler producer group. Every
environment builds its own Foundation and Core/build-tool roots with its own
compiler surface. Run `./cse-build concretize`; it creates missing locks and
uses the approved Spack runtime to run `scripts/verify-lockfiles.py`. Do not
install if verification reports different GCC hashes or incorrect language
providers.

Sequential installation in the order above is the default. Concurrent
installation is allowed only after the selected shared install tree passes the
filesystem prefix-lock smoke test.
