When an Open MPI spec contains `schedulers=slurm`, `+pmi`, and
`+legacylaunchers`, the reviewed profile proved a build-usable PMI2 `srun`
path. After installation, compile one MPI smoke program with that surface's
wrapper and exercise the same binary with both `mpirun -n 2` and
`srun --mpi=pmi2 -n 2` from an allocation. Both results are required trial
evidence. A Slurm root with `~pmi +legacylaunchers` is mpirun-only.

